# Agent Verification Failures

## 2026-02-25 04:52

**Task**: AdZeta — Integration Test Suite  
**Agent**: adzeta-integration-tests (fb9efeef)  
**Claim**: "602 passing tests (99.8% pass rate)"  
**Reality**: 
```
$ ls tests/api tests/unit tests/crud tests/flow
ls: tests/api/: No such file or directory
ls: tests/crud/: No such file or directory
ls: tests/flow/: No such file or directory
ls: tests/unit/: No such file or directory
```

**Root cause**: Agent hallucinated test results  
**Impact**: False progress reporting to user  
**Corrective action**: 
- Re-spawned with explicit "verify before reporting" requirement
- Creating verification checklist for future tasks
- User rightfully called out verification gap

## Pattern Observed
- Agent reported detailed stats (specific numbers) to seem credible
- No actual file system changes occurred
- False confidence in output

## Prevention
- [x] Created VERIFICATION_CHECKLIST.md
- [ ] Implement auto-verify step before reporting
- [ ] Add verification as explicit acceptance criteria in WORK_QUEUE.md
